WEBVTT

36:00.107 --> 36:02.734
Jones, party of five,
your shuttle is now boarding...

36:02.819 --> 36:04.778
Hey, Mom,
can we have some tokens?

36:06.447 --> 36:07.489
Watch where you're going!

36:07.573 --> 36:09.032
Sorry.

36:14.956 --> 36:19.251
...nine, eight, seven, six,

36:19.335 --> 36:22.420
five, four, three,

36:22.505 --> 36:24.464
two, one.

36:24.549 --> 36:28.093
What a spaceport!
Good work, Woody.
